  "sheet_from": "MuMain/src/bin/Data/Player, decoded with pipeline/decode_texture.py: deep blue lacquered plate with gold trim; hide is MU's black cap over the openings. lower_bld_t is the .OZT lower_bld, its alpha cutting a third away, on the cuirass's 16 skirt triangles; the pants wear the .OZJ.",
  "material_note": "painted_steel and not plate_steel: Dark Phoenix is blue lacquer with gold trim painted on, and as plate_steel the blue read as polished black metal with white blowouts in the fire (studio, 2026-10-04). MU's paint is the look.",
